marks.tex, linepens.tex, middle.tex: oracle .log made by `pdftex -ini -etex -interaction=batchmode core.tex` (pdfTeX 1.40.29, SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH=1 FORCE_SOURCE_DATE=1), core.tex being tests/etex.rs's prelude, the fixture and `\end`; the log from `(./core.tex` to the last ` )`. marks.dvi: the same run's DVI file (the values the text reads after the last page are typeset, not \message'd: the .log's order is not an output).
